  "description": "An ordinary girl is reincarnated as Diana, the heroine of a third-rate novel who marries the male lead and ends up dying from being overworked as a healer. Earning a spot at the Academy of Magic is just the beginning — can she sidestep the male lead and find a happy ending with Rozen, the man of her dreams?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
